# Bow draw (graphics/mesh/bowdraw): the right hand draws the string by hand, the arrow with it; the reload. Close by
# from the side and from the front: the hand going to the string after the raise, a slow draw (a novice),
# a quick one (a master), held, the shot, the reload; a draw let down without a shot; `bowdraw off` for
# the animation as it is (drawn fully all the time)
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_VALLEY_01
turn 225
wait 500
equip ItRw_Bow_L_01
give ItRw_Arrow 100
insert BAU_904_BAUER
wait 300
immortal BAU_904_BAUER on
pin BAU_904_BAUER 1000 0 0
aimat BAU_904_BAUER body
tap bow
wait 1500
cam follow 220 150 90             # the left side: the arrow's line across the frame
cam look 145
wait 300

stats str 15 dex 15 bow 10
rec novice_side
volley 2 600
stop

stats str 120 dex 120 bow 100
rec master_side
volley 2 600
stop

# drawn a little, let go: no shot, the string goes back
rec letdown
volley 1 0 0.1
wait 800
stop

bowdraw off
rec off_side
volley 1 600
stop
bowdraw on

cam follow 170 150 -50            # in front, on the right: the drawing hand
wait 300
rec master_front
volley 2 600
stop

# the reload at another tempo (dexterity sets it, 0.85..1.6): the arrow in the hand, the string's morphs,
# the sounds - each event once, in the same order (bench.log: "anim event", "anim morph")
cam follow 220 150 60
wait 300
animspeed T_BOWRELOAD 0.7
rec tempo07
volley 2 300
stop
animspeed T_BOWRELOAD 1.5
rec tempo15
volley 2 300
stop

# held too long: past the hold limit the arms tremble (the head does not), then the shot
animspeed T_BOWRELOAD 1
stats str 15 dex 15 bow 10
cam follow 150 155 -50
wait 300
rec tremble
volley 1 7000
stop

# the reload slowly, from still cameras: the upper body holds the aim (the bow stays up), the hand reaches
# over the shoulder for the arrow and brings it straight to the string, off the head
stats str 120 dex 120 bow 100
wait 300
animspeed T_BOWRELOAD 0.7
cam world 200 150 135
cam look 140
wait 300
rec reload_side
volley 1 300
wait 600
stop
cam world 200 150 315
cam look 140
wait 300
rec reload_back
volley 1 300
wait 600
stop

# as the player sees it: the game's camera over the shoulder, the master's tempo
animspeed T_BOWRELOAD 1.45
view full
cam game
wait 500
rec game
volley 2 300
wait 300
stop
